    "body": "Given how fast people converged here, the same people may be interested in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5426 , which proposes making changes to other hard-coded colors.\r\n\r\nThe latest list of to-dos was in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5426#issuecomment-903998243 . Although, looking at how this was resolved, it seems like maybe my step (1) there is not a blocker? After that the thread got hijacked by the color-contrast debate that seems to be raging across multiple repositories... I'm hopeful some strong implementer involvement could get things back on track.",
